<title>GREECE: Greek WPI inflation drops to 2.6pct y/y in March.</title>
<headline>Greek WPI inflation drops to 2.6pct y/y in March.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's wholesale price inflation fell to 2.6 percent year-on-year in March from 3.4 percent in February, the National Statistics Service (NSS) said in a statement released today.</p>
<p>    Wholesale Price Index   March 97   February 97    March 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month (pct)	 0.0	   0.5	    0.8</p>
<p>    Year-on-year (pct)	   2.6	   3.4	    6.7</p>
<p>    Index (1980=100)	   877.3	 877.2	  855.4</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
